y:e=>"Young family — you'll have access to the best plans at the most affordable premiums. Starting now means all waiting periods finish while you're still young and likely healthy. Really smart timing.",ageInsightGeneric:e=>"Great age profile — you'll get competitive premiums and the widest choice of plans.",ageAckHospitalIntro:"Now let me find cashless hospitals near you — this is important because cashless treatment means zero out-of-pocket at the hospital.",pdfNextPreFill:e=>e?"".concat(e," I've pulled key details from your policy — let me confirm them so we can skip the repetitive questions."):"I've pulled key details from your policy — let me confirm them so we can skip the repetitive questions.",pincodeQ:"Aapka pincode kya hai? Isse mujhe aapke paas ke cashless hospitals dikhane mein madad milegi.",pincodePlaceholder:"6-digit pincode daalein",hospitalResult:e=>"Badhiya khabar — aapke paas ".concat(e,"+ cashless hospitals! Ye aise hospitals hain jahaan aap ACKO card dikhaake bina payment ke ilaaj kara sakte hain."),currentInsuranceQ:e=>"".concat(e,", kya aapke paas abhi koi health insurance hai? Sabhi applicable options select karein.\n\nIsse mujhe sahi coverage suggest karne mein madad milegi."),totalCoverContextGmcBoth:"What's the total health cover you have across your employer insurance and personal policy combined",totalCoverContextGmc:"What's the total health cover you have from your employer",totalCoverContextPolicy:"What's the total health cover you have from your current policy",totalCoverSuffix:"?\n\nThis tells me how much protection you already have, so I can identify gaps and recommend the right amount of additional cover.",gapCheckQ:"Would you like to understand if your current cover is really enough?\n\nThis is the most common question we get — and the answer surprises most people.",gapCheckYes:"Yes, let's check",gapCheckYesSub:"Takes 30 seconds",gapCheckSkip:"Skip, show me plans",gapScenario:(e,a)=>"Let's look at this practically.\n\nA major hospitalisation in ".concat(e," — like a heart surgery or cancer treatment — can cost ₹10-20 lakhs. Your current cover is ").concat(a,".\n\nBut here's what most people don't realize: employer insurance typically has room rent caps (₹5,000-8,000/day), excludes consumables (₹15,000-50,000 per surgery), and stops the day you change jobs.\n\nAfter these deductions, your effective cover could be just 40-60% of the actual bill."),gapInsightGmc:"That's why a personal health plan alongside your employer cover is important. It stays with you regardless of your job, covers the gaps your GMC doesn't, and gives your family real protection.\n\nLet me understand your health profile next — this helps me recommend the right plan.",gapInsightOther:"Based on what you've shared, there may be room for stronger coverage. Let me understand your health profile to give you a precise recommendation.",employerGMC:"Employer insurance (GMC)",personalPolicy:"Personal health policy",noInsurance:"Abhi koi insurance nahi",noInsuranceAck:e=>"Abhi se isko dekhna bohot smart move hai, ".concat(e,". India mein 70% health expenses jeb se hoti hain — health insurance ye badalta hai.\n\nBest plan suggest karne ke liye aapki health profile samajh lete hain."),switchAck:"Achha jaanke achha laga. ACKO pe switch karne pe aapke waiting period credits aur no-claim bonus carry over hote hain.\n\nChaliye ab aapki health profile samajhte hain.",conditionsQ:"Kya aapki family mein kisi ko ye conditions hain? Sabhi applicable select karein.\n\nYe zaroori hai kyunki isse waiting periods aur best plans pe asar padta hai. Chinta mat karein — pre-existing conditions aapko disqualify nahi karte.",healthyAck:(e,a)=>"Bohot achha, ".concat(e,"! Healthy family ka matlab hai zyada plan options, kam premiums, aur easy health evaluation.\n\nAb ").concat(a," ke liye sahi coverage amount suggest karta hoon."),conditionsAck:e=>"Batane ke liye shukriya, ".concat(e,". Pre-existing conditions bohot common hain — humare 40% se zyada policyholders ke paas hain. Main aisa plan suggest karunga jisme in conditions ka sabse achha coverage ho."),calculating:"Aapke liye sabse achhe options taiyaar kar raha hoon...",healthEvalLab:"Based on the health conditions shared, a visit to a nearby diagnostic lab will be needed. This includes blood tests, ECG, and other diagnostics — it helps us confirm coverage terms.\n\nLet's pick a convenient date, time, and lab near you.",healthEvalDoctorCall:"Your health evaluation involves a phone call with our doctor and basic medical tests at home. It takes about 30 minutes and is completely free.\n\nLet's schedule it.",healthEvalQuestionsOnly:"Good news — your health evaluation is just a few simple questions online. No physical tests needed! This is because your family's health profile is straightforward.",healthEvalLabSchedule:"Choose your preferred date, time, and lab below. We'll send you a confirmation with preparation instructions.",recommendationGmc:(e,a,o)=>"".concat(e,", here are plans that work alongside your employer cover. I've included a top-up option that's perfect for filling GMC gaps. Switch between them to compare what's covered."),recommendationStandard:(e,a,o)=>"".concat(e,", here are the best plans for ").concat(a," at ₹").concat(o,' coverage. Each plan has different strengths — expand "What\'s covered" to see the details and what each feature means.'),frequencyQ:"Aap kaise pay karna chahenge? Yearly payment se 8% bachti hai — lagbhag ek mahina free.",saveEight:"Recommended — 8% bachaayein",reviewMsg:e=>"".concat(e,", ye raha aapke plan ka poora summary. Details dekhein, payment ke baad main health evaluation mein guide karunga."),consentMsg:"Sab theek hai? Payment ke liye aage badhein. Agar health evaluation mein kuch unexpected aaya to poora refund — koi sawaal nahi.",dobMsg:(e,a)=>"Almost ho gaya, ".concat(e,"! Please ").concat(1===a?"apni":"sabhi ".concat(a," members ki")," date of birth daalein. Sahi premium calculate karne ke liye zaroori hai."),dob